        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: EuropaCorp\n- Places: Saint-Denis, Paris, Europe\n- Industries: film industry, motion picture industry\n- Organizations: film production companies, film studios\n- Roles: actors, film directors, film crew personnel\n- Topics: filmmaking, cinematography, animation, screenwriting, pre-production, post production, film festivals, distribution\n\nFacts:\n- EuropaCorp is a French motion picture company headquartered in Saint-Denis, a northern suburb of Paris.\n- EuropaCorp is one of a few full-service independent studios that both produces and distributes feature films.\n- EuropaCorp is one of the major companies in Europe.\n- The film industry, also called the motion picture industry, comprises the technological and commercial institutions of filmmaking.\n- The film industry includes film production companies, film studios, cinematography, animation, film production, screenwriting, pre-production, post production, film festivals, and distribution.\n- The film industry includes actors, film directors, and other film crew personnel.",
